[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "start": 3.5,
    "end": 7.46,
    "text": "is what the entrepreneurs believe will be the next big hip talk."
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "start": 17.6,
    "end": 18.88,
    "text": "I'm Austin Hillam."
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "start": 19.18,
    "end": 20.6,
    "text": "And I'm Stephen Fazio."
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "start": 21.24,
    "end": 24.24,
    "text": "Throughout the decades, we have been introduced to objects"
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "start": 24.24,
    "end": 27.2,
    "text": "that have entertained and engaged millions."
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "start": 27.96,
    "end": 30.74,
    "text": "Early on, it was the yo-yo."
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "start": 31.32,
    "end": 33.88,
    "text": "In the 60s, we had the Etcher sketch."
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "start": 34.76,
    "end": 37.06,
    "text": "In the 80s, there was the Rubik's Cube."
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "start": 38.02,
    "end": 42.46,
    "text": "Now introducing the toy of the future."
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "start": 43.96,
    "end": 53.76,
    "text": "Fuser does, zip string follows."
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "start": 54.58,
    "end": 57.36,
    "text": "The string flies around 35 miles per hour,"
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "start": 57.68,
    "end": 59.02,
    "text": "and yet is safe to the touch."
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "start": 59.76,
    "end": 61.72,
    "text": "Ice Sharks, watch this trick."
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "start": 62.02,
    "end": 63.26,
    "text": "It's called the swirl."
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "start": 65.58,
    "end": 67.24,
    "text": "This one's the corkscrew."
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "start": 68.1,
    "end": 69.6,
    "text": "This one's the step-through."
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "start": 74.01,
    "end": 75.63,
    "text": "Presenting the portal."
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "start": 78.84,
    "end": 82.02,
    "text": "Zip string glides around smooth objects."
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "start": 83.38,
    "end": 84.88,
    "text": "All smooth objects."
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "start": 86.94,
    "end": 88.78,
    "text": "Zip string is taking the world by storm."
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "start": 88.98,
    "end": 90.22,
    "text": "Oh my god, it's so cool."
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "start": 91.02,
    "end": 94.16,
    "text": "We are here for a $100,000 investment"
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "start": 94.16,
    "end": 95.96,
    "text": "for 10% of our business."
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "start": 96.7,
    "end": 98.8,
    "text": "Sharks, who's ready to zip?"
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "start": 100.84,
    "end": 102.2,
    "text": "Let's show you guys how it works."
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "start": 102.34,
    "end": 103.38,
    "text": "Some of you have already figured it out."
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "start": 103.96,
    "end": 105.74,
    "text": "So what you want to do is you want to hold it"
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "start": 105.74,
    "end": 108.22,
    "text": "upright like this with the logo facing outwards."
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "start": 108.22,
    "end": 109.46,
    "text": "Oh, yeah!"
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "start": 113.98,
    "end": 114.8,
    "text": "Do you like some movements?"
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "start": 115.54,
    "end": 116.22,
    "text": "Guys, come on."
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "start": 116.4,
    "end": 119.24,
    "text": "I love it too!"
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "start": 119.9,
    "end": 120.78,
    "text": "Did you invent it?"
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "start": 121.12,
    "end": 121.42,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "start": 121.72,
    "end": 123.38,
    "text": "Tell us the story, how you came up with it."
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "start": 123.78,
    "end": 125.3,
    "text": "I'm super passionate about electronics."
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "start": 125.68,
    "end": 128.5,
    "text": "A couple years ago, I watched a physics teacher"
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "start": 128.5,
    "end": 131.42,
    "text": "demonstrate a Benchtop string launcher."
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "start": 131.84,
    "end": 135.42,
    "text": "He had this device that would launch a string in a loop."
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "start": 135.88,
    "end": 137.6,
    "text": "And I took that Benchtop version,"
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "start": 138.0,
    "end": 140.26,
    "text": "I compacted it, made it handheld,"
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "start": 140.72,
    "end": 142.22,
    "text": "and I made this prototype."
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "start": 143.28,
    "end": 148.9,
    "text": "Everybody loved it, but I knew I couldn't make a scalable business out of it, until I had Austin over."
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "start": 149.42,
    "end": 151.0,
    "text": "We were just nerding out about this device."
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "start": 151.6,
    "end": 155.26,
    "text": "My father had some great input, and we turned it into a toy."
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "start": 155.86,
    "end": 161.04,
    "text": "I put that toy on my social media, and by the end of the day it had over 20 million views."
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "start": 161.34,
    "end": 161.76,
    "text": "What?"
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "start": 162.6,
    "end": 164.22,
    "text": "It hit the front page of Reddit."
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "start": 164.74,
    "end": 165.86,
    "text": "Oh my gosh."
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "start": 166.04,
    "end": 167.58,
    "text": "It went just absolutely nuts."
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "start": 167.72,
    "end": 169.58,
    "text": "We had everybody reaching out to us."
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "start": 169.8,
    "end": 170.36,
    "text": "When was that?"
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "start": 170.36,
    "end": 172.46,
    "text": "was just over a year ago."
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "start": 172.88,
    "end": 174.32,
    "text": "So how many of you sold from all that?"
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "start": 174.7,
    "end": 176.02,
    "text": "We sold over 10,000."
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "start": 176.64,
    "end": 178.94,
    "text": "That's it? How much did you charge for them?"
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "start": 179.04,
    "end": 179.96,
    "text": "We started $25."
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "start": 180.74,
    "end": 183.54,
    "text": "Why would 20 million views you only sold that well?"
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "start": 183.56,
    "end": 184.58,
    "text": "There's a cost to make them."
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "start": 184.84,
    "end": 186.1,
    "text": "It cost $635."
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "start": 186.32,
    "end": 187.12,
    "text": "So here's what happened."
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "start": 187.56,
    "end": 189.88,
    "text": "So we did a Kickstarter, ran that successfully,"
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "start": 190.48,
    "end": 192.92,
    "text": "an all-American comedy group known as Dude Perfect"
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "start": 192.92,
    "end": 194.66,
    "text": "reached out. They loved it."
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "start": 194.88,
    "end": 196.92,
    "text": "They took it on a nationwide stage tour,"
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "start": 197.38,
    "end": 198.22,
    "text": "showed it around the world."
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "start": 198.22,
    "end": 202.04,
    "text": "Today, ZipString is in over 50 countries."
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "start": 202.56,
    "end": 204.34,
    "text": "We've had so much exposure."
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "start": 204.8,
    "end": 206.62,
    "text": "Over 200 million views in total."
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "start": 206.8,
    "end": 208.02,
    "text": "Austin, after the Kickstarter."
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "start": 208.34,
    "end": 208.52,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "start": 208.68,
    "end": 211.68,
    "text": "20 million views, national tour, all of that."
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "start": 211.86,
    "end": 212.06,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "start": 212.38,
    "end": 214.52,
    "text": "What were the total sales in dollars?"
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "start": 214.84,
    "end": 215.0,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "start": 216.88,
    "end": 217.92,
    "text": "$277,000."
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "start": 218.54,
    "end": 219.66,
    "text": "Why so little?"
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "start": 219.88,
    "end": 220.6,
    "text": "With all due respect."
  },
  {
    "id": 78,
    "start": 220.84,
    "end": 222.58,
    "text": "If we didn't have the 20 million views"
  },
  {
    "id": 79,
    "start": 222.58,
    "end": 223.46,
    "text": "and all the other stuff."
  },
  {
    "id": 80,
    "start": 223.54,
    "end": 223.92,
    "text": "Sure, sure, sure."
  },
  {
    "id": 81,
    "start": 223.92,
    "end": 225.04,
    "text": "I'd say, hey, great start."
  },
  {
    "id": 82,
    "start": 225.52,
    "end": 227.86,
    "text": "Why this and only this?"
  },
  {
    "id": 83,
    "start": 227.86,
    "end": 232.8,
    "text": "Supply chain we are struggling to figure that out the demand was there pre-orders were coming"
  },
  {
    "id": 84,
    "start": 232.8,
    "end": 238.12,
    "text": "We couldn't make them fast enough. We weren't ready. Have you solved your supply chain problems?"
  },
  {
    "id": 85,
    "start": 238.34,
    "end": 241.5,
    "text": "Supply chain is all set up and you do an order for a hundred thousand units"
  },
  {
    "id": 86,
    "start": 241.5,
    "end": 246.74,
    "text": "We can as long as we have the case that reduced the price because right now you're paying 635 to make them"
  },
  {
    "id": 87,
    "start": 246.74,
    "end": 248.58,
    "text": "I know we can get it down to 587"
  },
  {
    "id": 88,
    "start": 249.18,
    "end": 250.7,
    "text": "$25 is too expensive"
  },
  {
    "id": 89,
    "start": 252.14,
    "end": 255.46,
    "text": "Spends in this a battery. That's the largest expense. That's correct"
  },
  {
    "id": 90,
    "start": 255.46,
    "end": 258.0,
    "text": "Why, you think $25 for this is expensive?"
  },
  {
    "id": 91,
    "start": 258.18,
    "end": 258.48,
    "text": "Yeah, I do."
  },
  {
    "id": 92,
    "start": 258.78,
    "end": 259.4,
    "text": "Yeah, I do."
  },
  {
    "id": 93,
    "start": 259.66,
    "end": 260.46,
    "text": "For little kids, yeah."
  },
  {
    "id": 94,
    "start": 260.62,
    "end": 261.8,
    "text": "For parents to buy for their little kids,"
  },
  {
    "id": 95,
    "start": 262.04,
    "end": 262.66,
    "text": "to keep them entertained."
  },
  {
    "id": 96,
    "start": 262.78,
    "end": 263.72,
    "text": "In 1995, it's five times the sales."
  },
  {
    "id": 97,
    "start": 263.72,
    "end": 263.84,
    "text": "Are you kidding?"
  },
  {
    "id": 98,
    "start": 264.18,
    "end": 266.32,
    "text": "Have you guys not bought stuffed animals lately?"
  },
  {
    "id": 99,
    "start": 266.32,
    "end": 269.98,
    "text": "Well, if you could be $9.95, you would sell them, like, billions."
  },
  {
    "id": 100,
    "start": 270.08,
    "end": 271.0,
    "text": "And here's what's happened."
  },
  {
    "id": 101,
    "start": 271.4,
    "end": 274.94,
    "text": "We've talked to him and have a verbal commitment with Walmart, Canada, to start"
  },
  {
    "id": 102,
    "start": 274.94,
    "end": 276.32,
    "text": "shipping and selling these."
  },
  {
    "id": 103,
    "start": 276.96,
    "end": 278.66,
    "text": "There, it'll be $14.97."
  },
  {
    "id": 104,
    "start": 279.74,
    "end": 280.8,
    "text": "I'll make you an offer."
  },
  {
    "id": 105,
    "start": 281.04,
    "end": 284.4,
    "text": "I'll take no equity whatsoever if I've ever seen a royalty deal as this one."
  },
  {
    "id": 106,
    "start": 284.4,
    "end": 290.4,
    "text": "I want a bucket unit and I'll give you the hundred thousand dollars and watch what I can do in blowing this thing up."
  },
  {
    "id": 107,
    "start": 290.72,
    "end": 291.98,
    "text": "There's only one Mr. Wonderful."
  },
  {
    "id": 108,
    "start": 292.56,
    "end": 293.52,
    "text": "Kevin is that in perpetuity?"
  },
  {
    "id": 109,
    "start": 293.52,
    "end": 295.22,
    "text": "Kevin, they don't have that big a margin."
  },
  {
    "id": 110,
    "start": 295.58,
    "end": 296.6,
    "text": "What's perpetuity, Robert?"
  },
  {
    "id": 111,
    "start": 297.04,
    "end": 297.22,
    "text": "Huge."
  },
  {
    "id": 112,
    "start": 297.34,
    "end": 297.54,
    "text": "Forever."
  },
  {
    "id": 113,
    "start": 298.0,
    "end": 298.88,
    "text": "Oh, yes it is."
  },
  {
    "id": 114,
    "start": 299.86,
    "end": 301.32,
    "text": "Here's what you're investing in."
  },
  {
    "id": 115,
    "start": 301.74,
    "end": 305.08,
    "text": "You're investing in a new category of toys."
  },
  {
    "id": 116,
    "start": 305.76,
    "end": 306.46,
    "text": "Really awesome."
  },
  {
    "id": 117,
    "start": 306.62,
    "end": 307.78,
    "text": "I've heard this my whole life."
  },
  {
    "id": 118,
    "start": 308.04,
    "end": 309.12,
    "text": "New categories of everything."
  },
  {
    "id": 119,
    "start": 309.58,
    "end": 310.76,
    "text": "This is a new category."
  },
  {
    "id": 120,
    "start": 311.26,
    "end": 312.66,
    "text": "We are the category kings."
  },
  {
    "id": 121,
    "start": 312.9,
    "end": 313.32,
    "text": "What do you think?"
  },
  {
    "id": 122,
    "start": 313.32,
    "end": 318.82,
    "text": "am I off? If there's no other offer, all of a sudden I'm feeling even more"
  },
  {
    "id": 123,
    "start": 318.82,
    "end": 325.24,
    "text": "wonderful. Let me jump in. I mean, I love the innovation, love you guys. I think it's"
  },
  {
    "id": 124,
    "start": 325.24,
    "end": 330.34,
    "text": "early, so I am taking myself out. I wish you good luck. It's nothing I could help"
  },
  {
    "id": 125,
    "start": 330.34,
    "end": 338.44,
    "text": "with, honestly. It's not for me to come out. All right, guys. Couldn't love them more."
  },
  {
    "id": 126,
    "start": 339.5,
    "end": 344.6,
    "text": "Seriously, the key for me is you got to keep going, right? You got to be"
  },
  {
    "id": 127,
    "start": 344.6,
    "end": 347.94,
    "text": "the cool, stringy, floaty,"
  },
  {
    "id": 128,
    "start": 348.52,
    "end": 350.1,
    "text": "scientisty, geeky product."
  },
  {
    "id": 129,
    "start": 350.62,
    "end": 352.14,
    "text": "That's the investment I want to make."
  },
  {
    "id": 130,
    "start": 352.54,
    "end": 353.7,
    "text": "That's the ride I want to go on."
  },
  {
    "id": 131,
    "start": 353.7,
    "end": 354.6,
    "text": "Is there an offer involved?"
  },
  {
    "id": 132,
    "start": 354.98,
    "end": 355.22,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "id": 133,
    "start": 355.6,
    "end": 360.24,
    "text": "I will give you 100,000 for 20%."
  },
  {
    "id": 134,
    "start": 360.76,
    "end": 363.76,
    "text": "I'll do 100,000 for 15%."
  },
  {
    "id": 135,
    "start": 363.76,
    "end": 366.06,
    "text": "I'll do 100,000 for 10%."
  },
  {
    "id": 136,
    "start": 367.18,
    "end": 369.86,
    "text": "Exactly what you offered if you take the deal."
  },
  {
    "id": 137,
    "start": 372.05,
    "end": 373.47,
    "text": "I'll give you extra."
  },
  {
    "id": 138,
    "start": 373.79,
    "end": 375.03,
    "text": "I'll do it for 9%."
  },
  {
    "id": 139,
    "start": 381.8,
    "end": 383.4,
    "text": "Can we take a second to talk real quick?"
  },
  {
    "id": 140,
    "start": 383.52,
    "end": 384.28,
    "text": "Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait."
  },
  {
    "id": 141,
    "start": 384.82,
    "end": 386.16,
    "text": "Guys, let me step in."
  },
  {
    "id": 142,
    "start": 386.9,
    "end": 388.6,
    "text": "What you guys have done is great, right?"
  },
  {
    "id": 143,
    "start": 388.8,
    "end": 389.44,
    "text": "It's creative."
  },
  {
    "id": 144,
    "start": 389.98,
    "end": 391.32,
    "text": "You've got a chance to make some money."
  },
  {
    "id": 145,
    "start": 391.64,
    "end": 395.02,
    "text": "But as an investment, I think if Peter's out at some point,"
  },
  {
    "id": 146,
    "start": 395.24,
    "end": 396.38,
    "text": "I don't really see it as being investable,"
  },
  {
    "id": 147,
    "start": 396.78,
    "end": 397.98,
    "text": "so for those reasons, I'm out."
  },
  {
    "id": 148,
    "start": 398.2,
    "end": 398.56,
    "text": "Oh!"
  },
  {
    "id": 149,
    "start": 398.68,
    "end": 399.46,
    "text": "Thank you, Mike."
  },
  {
    "id": 150,
    "start": 401.26,
    "end": 402.74,
    "text": "Robert, just thinking here,"
  },
  {
    "id": 151,
    "start": 403.64,
    "end": 406.4,
    "text": "you and me together for 20%..."
  },
  {
    "id": 152,
    "start": 406.4,
    "end": 407.14,
    "text": "For $100,000?"
  },
  {
    "id": 153,
    "start": 407.58,
    "end": 408.56,
    "text": "I like it!"
  },
  {
    "id": 154,
    "start": 408.64,
    "end": 409.32,
    "text": "You know why?"
  },
  {
    "id": 155,
    "start": 409.42,
    "end": 410.02,
    "text": "I like it, Kevin."
  },
  {
    "id": 156,
    "start": 410.02,
    "end": 411.76,
    "text": "You double your social media fall."
  },
  {
    "id": 157,
    "start": 411.92,
    "end": 414.5,
    "text": "You get two sharks, and we're a little sharky."
  },
  {
    "id": 158,
    "start": 414.72,
    "end": 417.7,
    "text": "Together, instead of us killing each other, we help you."
  },
  {
    "id": 159,
    "start": 418.0,
    "end": 418.54,
    "text": "Double trouble."
  },
  {
    "id": 160,
    "start": 418.84,
    "end": 419.38,
    "text": "Double trouble."
  },
  {
    "id": 161,
    "start": 419.56,
    "end": 421.76,
    "text": "So basically, we give you 100,000 for 20 cents."
  },
  {
    "id": 162,
    "start": 421.86,
    "end": 422.42,
    "text": "You get two sharks."
  },
  {
    "id": 163,
    "start": 422.88,
    "end": 423.7,
    "text": "Oh, I love that, Kevin."
  },
  {
    "id": 164,
    "start": 424.3,
    "end": 425.12,
    "text": "Guys, what's your chance?"
  },
  {
    "id": 165,
    "start": 425.12,
    "end": 426.34,
    "text": "$100,000 or 20%."
  },
  {
    "id": 166,
    "start": 426.34,
    "end": 428.16,
    "text": "100,000, 20% two of us."
  },
  {
    "id": 167,
    "start": 428.5,
    "end": 430.08,
    "text": "Your previous offers."
  },
  {
    "id": 168,
    "start": 430.7,
    "end": 431.4,
    "text": "Are those still available?"
  },
  {
    "id": 169,
    "start": 431.82,
    "end": 433.02,
    "text": "Are those still on the table?"
  },
  {
    "id": 170,
    "start": 433.32,
    "end": 435.7,
    "text": "There is no rear view mirror in my life."
  },
  {
    "id": 171,
    "start": 435.88,
    "end": 436.68,
    "text": "You got to let go."
  },
  {
    "id": 172,
    "start": 437.02,
    "end": 438.66,
    "text": "This is the deal in front of you right now."
  },
  {
    "id": 173,
    "start": 438.66,
    "end": 439.68,
    "text": "What do you want to do?"
  },
  {
    "id": 174,
    "start": 444.62,
    "end": 445.36,
    "text": "We're going to counter."
  },
  {
    "id": 175,
    "start": 447.48,
    "end": 451.2,
    "text": "The counter is, would you be willing to go for 15% together?"
  },
  {
    "id": 176,
    "start": 451.7,
    "end": 451.86,
    "text": "No!"
  },
  {
    "id": 177,
    "start": 452.32,
    "end": 452.82,
    "text": "You know why?"
  },
  {
    "id": 178,
    "start": 452.94,
    "end": 455.16,
    "text": "I want to get up in the morning and feel like I own a piece of it."
  },
  {
    "id": 179,
    "start": 455.2,
    "end": 456.32,
    "text": "Come on, we each own 10%."
  },
  {
    "id": 180,
    "start": 456.32,
    "end": 456.6,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "id": 181,
    "start": 456.76,
    "end": 459.92,
    "text": "This is a toy that's going to be in every house in America."
  },
  {
    "id": 182,
    "start": 459.92,
    "end": 461.82,
    "text": "We agree, which is why we made you the offer."
  },
  {
    "id": 183,
    "start": 462.0,
    "end": 466.92,
    "text": "You guys realized that you had an offer before at 9%, but you didn't grab it."
  },
  {
    "id": 184,
    "start": 467.06,
    "end": 468.4,
    "text": "So now you're sitting here 20."
  },
  {
    "id": 185,
    "start": 469.18,
    "end": 470.56,
    "text": "That happens to the shark sanctum."
  },
  {
    "id": 186,
    "start": 470.56,
    "end": 471.38,
    "text": "Yes, it does, Lord."
  },
  {
    "id": 187,
    "start": 471.38,
    "end": 473.38,
    "text": "Once you walk out with a deal, you get two sharks."
  },
  {
    "id": 188,
    "start": 473.52,
    "end": 474.68,
    "text": "That's extremely valuable."
  },
  {
    "id": 189,
    "start": 475.2,
    "end": 476.1,
    "text": "All right, uh-oh."
  },
  {
    "id": 190,
    "start": 477.28,
    "end": 478.16,
    "text": "What's going on?"
  },
  {
    "id": 191,
    "start": 479.22,
    "end": 479.62,
    "text": "Robert?"
  },
  {
    "id": 192,
    "start": 480.66,
    "end": 481.0,
    "text": "Kevin?"
  },
  {
    "id": 193,
    "start": 482.66,
    "end": 483.5,
    "text": "You got a deal."
  },
  {
    "id": 194,
    "start": 483.76,
    "end": 484.14,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "id": 195,
    "start": 486.56,
    "end": 487.2,
    "text": "Let's zip around."
  },
  {
    "id": 196,
    "start": 489.59,
    "end": 490.49,
    "text": "That's absolutely fantastic."
  },
  {
    "id": 197,
    "start": 490.73,
    "end": 491.23,
    "text": "I'm very excited."
  },
  {
    "id": 198,
    "start": 491.49,
    "end": 491.81,
    "text": "Thank you very much."
  },
  {
    "id": 199,
    "start": 491.81,
    "end": 493.15,
    "text": "This is the next thing that's going to happen."
  },
  {
    "id": 200,
    "start": 493.49,
    "end": 493.97,
    "text": "Yeah, yeah, yeah."
  },
  {
    "id": 201,
    "start": 494.23,
    "end": 495.01,
    "text": "Absolutely amazing."
  },
  {
    "id": 202,
    "start": 495.35,
    "end": 496.45,
    "text": "Let's build a big business."
  },
  {
    "id": 203,
    "start": 496.83,
    "end": 497.41,
    "text": "All right, guys."
  },
  {
    "id": 204,
    "start": 498.03,
    "end": 498.09,
    "text": "Let's go, guys."
  },
  {
    "id": 205,
    "start": 498.05,
    "end": 498.99,
    "text": "Let's go, guys."
  },
  {
    "id": 206,
    "start": 499.59,
    "end": 500.17,
    "text": "Take care, guys."
  },
  {
    "id": 207,
    "start": 500.69,
    "end": 501.25,
    "text": "What do you think, man?"
  },
  {
    "id": 208,
    "start": 501.59,
    "end": 502.55,
    "text": "Dude, two sharks."
  },
  {
    "id": 209,
    "start": 503.69,
    "end": 504.09,
    "text": "20%."
  },
  {
    "id": 210,
    "start": 504.09,
    "end": 508.61,
    "text": "You know $100,000 to 9% would have been the deal and we probably should have just grabbed it up"
  },
  {
    "id": 211,
    "start": 508.61,
    "end": 514.57,
    "text": "But you know, I don't think we lost it all in the end, but two sharks joining. I think this is gonna be exciting for us"
  },
  {
    "id": 212,
    "start": 514.57,
    "end": 515.55,
    "text": "Good day in the tank"
  }
]